## Summary

Generated Qwen3-8B TriAttention vs lucebox baseline comparison report (`docs/comparison_qwen3_8b_lucebox_20260518.md`):

**Key findings:**
- **TriAttention**: Up to 6.3x throughput (1405 tok/s) on MATH-500 with Qwen3-8B, KV Budget=1024
- **lucebox DFlash**: 2.55x-3.43x speedup (96-129 tok/s) on Qwen3.5-27B
- **Trade-offs**: TriAttention optimizes memory/compression for long contexts; DFlash optimizes decode speed
- **Complementary**: Both can work together — TriAttention handles memory, DFlash handles speed

The report documents verified stats file (`qwen3_8b_stats.pt`, 1.6 MB, 1152 heads) and includes runtime guidelines for both approaches.
